nance of Plantation along road side divide at \nNagpur. \n13.36 \nCommunity Development programme in six \nVillages by MOIL Foundation. \n93.78 \nTotal 170.70 \n \n-: 6 :- \n\n2016-17 \n \nParliamentary \nConstituency  \nName of the CSR activity undertaken CSR \nExpenditure \n(Rs. in Lakh) \nNagpur & Ramtek  \n(Maharashtra) \nSkill development to Local youths near operating \nmines. \n16.60 \nConstruction of RCC drain at village Umari, Tehsil \nSaoner, District Nagpur.  \n12.45 \nConstruction of roof top shed at Deaf and Dumb \nSchool at Saoner, District Nagpur. \n10.83 \nConstruction of Toilet & Urinal Blocks in Kashi Devi \nschool (Government Aided) at Musewadi, Tehsil \nRamtek, District Nagpur (M.S).  \n6.08 \nConstruction of boundary Wall of Ramakrishna \nSarada Mission School of Home Science, \nKamptee, District Nagpur(M.S.).  \n15.29 \nConstruction of Toilet & Urinal Blocks in Kashi Devi \nSchool (Government Aided) at Musewadi, Tehsil  \nRamtek, District Nagpur (M.S). \n6.08 \nLight to Lives – Project to Alleviate Visual \nImpairment and Blindness in rural communities \naround MOIL Mines.  \n35.04 \nConstruction of Cement Concrete Road & Drains in \ndifferent wards at Village Fetri, District Nagpur.  \n29.55 \nSupply of tree guards for plantation programme run \nby NMC. \n10.11 \nCommunity Development Programme. 35.11 \nRepairs to Hume Pipe Culvert at Village Fetri, \nDistrict  Nagpur. \n5.30 \nTarring of Road at Village Khapa, District Nagpur. 13.68 \nConstruction of Sabha Mandap at Village Fetri, \nDistrict Nagpur. \n14.01 \nInstallation of Benches at Public Park in village \nFetri, District Nagpur. \n0.80 \nSupply of Ambulance & Hearse vans to Tehsil \nNagbhid & Chimur. \n31.02 \nSponsoring 30 Patients for cleft lip surgeries.  3.00 \nConstruction of Community Toilet at Village Satuk. 3.32 \nFinancial assistant to terminally ill patients. 0.90 \nSponsorship for Vigyan Bharati. 1.00 \nDrilling of Bore wells & Installation of Hand Pumps \nin various villages.